{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u8bb8\u613f\u5c9b Hope Isle",
    "steam_appid": 3092580,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/3e68adfff0f77dca69a6c74fe3031492.avif?t=1753174689\" width=614 height=350 /></span><br><br>One day, a towering Tree of Hope grew out of the Sea of Sorrows, and at the base of this tree a small island gradually formed, our Wish Island. You can write down your wishes in the game, and the spirits on the island will pray for them to come true.<br><br>\u201cSome wishes are best kept in your heart.\u201d If you don\u2019t want others to always see your written wishes, you can switch them to encrypted runes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/e8217d032c3ce90a9322db2aeba0da9e.webp?t=1753174689\" width=358 height=42 /></span><br>The person who discovers this island becomes the master of Wish Island\u2014that\u2019s you. You can summon more spirits, expand and develop the island, and add various features like shops, fishing spots, farming, and more.<br><br>Since the island exists in another dimension, the island master can only interact with the various elements on the island through a beam of light. The spirits also rely on this light to feel the master\u2019s care and attention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/cca72d3b3bb606783161812773593868.avif?t=1753174689\" width=614 height=216 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/8c300c74eac82e161b49b041488f60bd.webp?t=1753174689\" width=519 height=44 /></span><br>The waters around the island are rich in resources, and the fertile soil is suitable for growing various crops. You can obtain these resources through fishing, farming, and trading in shops.<br><br>As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock cooking and crafting features, allowing you to use these resources to create food and toys that the spirits love, enriching their lives. Their happiness and satisfaction will be your most valuable treasures, motivating them to pray even more earnestly for your wishes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/b1cd86fc91f38d4e8433cf93f207b279.avif?t=1753174689\" width=615 height=216 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/5a1ea744e87e290f01845fc40ad5d7ad.webp?t=1753174689\" width=396 height=41 /></span><br>Praying is the spirits' innate duty, but they also enjoy their personal time after work, relaxing or playing freely in the small world you design.<br><br>With diverse personalities, they may become best friends or have tense relationships when they encounter each other on the island. In your spare time, you\u2019ll need to look after the spirits' moods, drop beams of light to guide them through their troubles, or share in their moments of joy and satisfaction!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/03ec6c42f9f27a091720991bf63c8664.avif?t=1753174689\" width=615 height=216 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/cdbe5044865fea25685457ef48ae6647.webp?t=1753174689\" width=337 height=40 /></span><br>Day after day, the spirits will climb to the treetops to continue their prayers, while the island masters continue their lives in their own world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/414ac348565bb3e8580484a54a9607be.avif?t=1753174689\" width=614 height=216 /></span><br><br>If you\u2019re working hard toward your wishes, you can <i>summon the spirits to your desktop</i> to accompany you during your busy times.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/fcadb23c28822b97473463b39bcd672b.poster.avif?t=1753174689\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/fcadb23c28822b97473463b39bcd672b.webm?t=1753174689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/fcadb23c28822b97473463b39bcd672b.mp4?t=1753174689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/3e68adfff0f77dca69a6c74fe3031492.avif?t=1753174689\" width=614 height=350 /></span><br><br>One day, a towering Tree of Hope grew out of the Sea of Sorrows, and at the base of this tree a small island gradually formed, our Wish Island. You can write down your wishes in the game, and the spirits on the island will pray for them to come true.<br><br>\u201cSome wishes are best kept in your heart.\u201d If you don\u2019t want others to always see your written wishes, you can switch them to encrypted runes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/e8217d032c3ce90a9322db2aeba0da9e.webp?t=1753174689\" width=358 height=42 /></span><br>The person who discovers this island becomes the master of Wish Island\u2014that\u2019s you. You can summon more spirits, expand and develop the island, and add various features like shops, fishing spots, farming, and more.<br><br>Since the island exists in another dimension, the island master can only interact with the various elements on the island through a beam of light. The spirits also rely on this light to feel the master\u2019s care and attention.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/cca72d3b3bb606783161812773593868.avif?t=1753174689\" width=614 height=216 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/8c300c74eac82e161b49b041488f60bd.webp?t=1753174689\" width=519 height=44 /></span><br>The waters around the island are rich in resources, and the fertile soil is suitable for growing various crops. You can obtain these resources through fishing, farming, and trading in shops.<br><br>As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock cooking and crafting features, allowing you to use these resources to create food and toys that the spirits love, enriching their lives. Their happiness and satisfaction will be your most valuable treasures, motivating them to pray even more earnestly for your wishes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/b1cd86fc91f38d4e8433cf93f207b279.avif?t=1753174689\" width=615 height=216 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/5a1ea744e87e290f01845fc40ad5d7ad.webp?t=1753174689\" width=396 height=41 /></span><br>Praying is the spirits' innate duty, but they also enjoy their personal time after work, relaxing or playing freely in the small world you design.<br><br>With diverse personalities, they may become best friends or have tense relationships when they encounter each other on the island. In your spare time, you\u2019ll need to look after the spirits' moods, drop beams of light to guide them through their troubles, or share in their moments of joy and satisfaction!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/03ec6c42f9f27a091720991bf63c8664.avif?t=1753174689\" width=615 height=216 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/cdbe5044865fea25685457ef48ae6647.webp?t=1753174689\" width=337 height=40 /></span><br>Day after day, the spirits will climb to the treetops to continue their prayers, while the island masters continue their lives in their own world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/414ac348565bb3e8580484a54a9607be.avif?t=1753174689\" width=614 height=216 /></span><br><br>If you\u2019re working hard toward your wishes, you can <i>summon the spirits to your desktop</i> to accompany you during your busy times.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/fcadb23c28822b97473463b39bcd672b.poster.avif?t=1753174689\" width=600 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/fcadb23c28822b97473463b39bcd672b.webm?t=1753174689\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092580/extras/fcadb23c28822b97473463b39bcd672b.mp4?t=1753174689\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "This is a &quot;blessing&quot; game designed to bring you good luck, combining idle mechanics, desktop pets, farming, fishing, and homebuilding. On this island born from your wishes, each adorable spirit will accompany you every day, offering sincere prayers for your heart's desires!",
